Description: Code editor with a local-first AI agent
 PSCode is a fork of Visual Studio Code with an AI assistant built into the
 product rather than added as an extension: chat with workspace context,
 inline edit, and an agentic tool loop that reads and edits your files.
 It talks to a model on your own machine (Ollama by default), so no API key
 is required and no source code leaves the computer.
